{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementLevel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementLevel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_min","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_min","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L44-L44","doc":"and no smaller index does — this is what makes it the *minimum*. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_valid","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L42-L42","doc":"`level` sits in the filtration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Confinement level `ℓ ∈ ℕ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","kind":"structure","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L32-L44","doc":"**Confinement level** of a closed braid at substrate parameter `q`.\n\n`valid` is the filtration predicate `fun d ℓ => T_w(d) ∈ J^ℓ(d.q)`, carried\nas a parameter — a function of the datum — so that `level` is determined by\nthe braid rather than chosen freely alongside it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:confinement-level","label":"def:confinement-level","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.q","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.nStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.nStrands","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Number of strands `n(K)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.braidIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.braidIndex","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L26-L26","doc":"The closed braid (encoded by its NF permutation index). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum","kind":"structure","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.lean#L22-L30","doc":"The braid datum a confinement level is taken at: a closed braid (by its NF\npermutation index) with a strand count, at a substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0}]}